column.value:
Hello ${firstname}, your transfer of *${transactionAmount}* on *${transactionDate}* was successful.
*From:* ${sourceClientName} (${sourceOfficeName}) - Acc: ${fromAccountNumber}
*To:* ${targetClientName} (${targetOfficeName}) - Acc: ${toAccountNumber}
*Description:* ${transferDescription}
*IP Address:* ${ipAddress}
*Ref:* ${transferId}
